      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:715614474ca4cf683cb6b55611391f4f3c7aa73c96e073e7ce485313db65533b",
      "text": "Galantamine recommendations also differ by guideline and date: the 2019 MDS review calls it possibly useful despite insufficient PD dementia efficacy evidence; the 2024 German guideline recommends against its use.",
